(7587022, 1221639, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment<br/> <br/>Wow -  from this angle it looks like a stained glass nautilus! Stunning, I love how the light illuminates these spiral stained glass windows. The sparkling jewel like tones dazzle the eye and the shape draws the eye in to travel down the spiral path. Wonderful capture!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment Wow -  from this angle it looks like a stained glass nautilus! Stunning, I love how the light illuminates these spiral stained glass windows. The sparkling jewel like tones dazzle the eye and the shape draws the eye in to travel down the spiral path. Wonderful capture!', '2018-07-30 10:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587024, 1221596, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Fantastic colors and shapes in this colorful still life! Love the refraction that captures all the colors of the bottles into the glass in front ''painting'' it with vibrant stripes of color. Lighting and details in this photo are excellent.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Fantastic colors and shapes in this colorful still life! Love the refraction that captures all the colors of the bottles into the glass in front ''painting'' it with vibrant stripes of color. Lighting and details in this photo are excellent.', '2018-07-30 10:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587029, 1222335, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful bold and vibrant rainbow of colors in this photo! I really like the arrangement where the shape of the colorful papers swirl/curve towards a central point. The pattern that the curving papers create is appealing to the eye and captivates the attention. Nicely done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful bold and vibrant rainbow of colors in this photo! I really like the arrangement where the shape of the colorful papers swirl/curve towards a central point. The pattern that the curving papers create is appealing to the eye and captivates the attention. Nicely done!', '2018-07-30 10:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587031, 1221442, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I love the clean, minimalist approach! The colorful arrangement of buttons on the paper white shirt are a vibrant pop of color! Nicely done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I love the clean, minimalist approach! The colorful arrangement of buttons on the paper white shirt are a vibrant pop of color! Nicely done!', '2018-07-30 10:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
