(7587557, 1222129, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the picture... she''s adorable and I love her expression and excitement ... nicely composed with the background layers.  But, the challenge is about objects and the only real object IMO is her glasses.  SO, if you had titled this "glasses" or "the better to see you with", I would have scored this higher.</td>', 'I like the picture... she''s adorable and I love her expression and excitement ... nicely composed with the background layers.  But, the challenge is about objects and the only real object IMO is her glasses.  SO, if you had titled this "glasses" or "the better to see you with", I would have scored this higher.', '2018-07-31 14:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
