(7587673, 1222407, 124815, '<td valign="top">A curious image; the more I look at it the more intrigued I am. First I thought that the grass was superfluous, but it comes with the bird! And the tall bird found itself in the presence of intriguing creatures of its own kind. There is something comic and melancholy about this ensemble and I bump it accordingly.</td>', 'A curious image; the more I look at it the more intrigued I am. First I thought that the grass was superfluous, but it comes with the bird! And the tall bird found itself in the presence of intriguing creatures of its own kind. There is something comic and melancholy about this ensemble and I bump it accordingly.', '2018-07-31 20:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587678, 1221746, 124815, '<td valign="top">Ha! I have two or 3 of these books and I strongly recommend Terzani''s Le Grand Voyage. Where is it? Wish I was there for a day or two<br/>bump</td>', 'Ha! I have two or 3 of these books and I strongly recommend Terzani''s Le Grand Voyage. Where is it? Wish I was there for a day or twobump', '2018-07-31 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
