(7587750, 1221793, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful and vibrant colors in this photo! Love the jewel-like tones, shapes, and surface textures I see in this composition.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful and vibrant colors in this photo! Love the jewel-like tones, shapes, and surface textures I see in this composition.', '2018-07-31 22:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587751, 1222267, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Colorful, airy and light! This visual treat has zero calories but is loaded with tasty colors! Puns aside - wonderful arrangement of the cupcake wrappers with some splendid colors that captivate the eye. Lighting and details are fantastic showing off hues and ridge patterns of the subject. Nicely done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Colorful, airy and light! This visual treat has zero calories but is loaded with tasty colors! Puns aside - wonderful arrangement of the cupcake wrappers with some splendid colors that captivate the eye. Lighting and details are fantastic showing off hues and ridge patterns of the subject. Nicely done!', '2018-07-31 22:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587752, 1222189, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful bold and bright colors of these hot air balloons! Love the light and patterns that are very appealing to my eye. Great angle for you place the viewer in the scene as one looks up from standing next to the two balloons on the ground that frame the red and white striped balloon that rises above us.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful bold and bright colors of these hot air balloons! Love the light and patterns that are very appealing to my eye. Great angle for you place the viewer in the scene as one looks up from standing next to the two balloons on the ground that frame the red and white striped balloon that rises above us.', '2018-07-31 22:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587755, 1222282, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful rainbow display of colorful umbrellas! Love the light that illuminates the underside of the umbrellas making them pop visually.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful rainbow display of colorful umbrellas! Love the light that illuminates the underside of the umbrellas making them pop visually.', '2018-07-31 22:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587757, 1221991, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful bold and bright colors on those shirts! Great idea - love this presentation where the viewer is observing the scene as one looks through the racks for a shirt to one''s liking! And it is not just the bright colors that capture the attention, but the patterns/shapes of color and well as some fantastic detail in textures of the shirts. Well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful bold and bright colors on those shirts! Great idea - love this presentation where the viewer is observing the scene as one looks through the racks for a shirt to one''s liking! And it is not just the bright colors that capture the attention, but the patterns/shapes of color and well as some fantastic detail in textures of the shirts. Well done!', '2018-07-31 22:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587765, 1222382, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Bright, bold and colorful fishing lures to bait the eye''s attention! Lighting and details are great. The two tone pink fishing bobbers add another pop of color to the yellows, greens, and oranges in the lures and feathers.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Bright, bold and colorful fishing lures to bait the eye''s attention! Lighting and details are great. The two tone pink fishing bobbers add another pop of color to the yellows, greens, and oranges in the lures and feathers.', '2018-07-31 22:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587768, 1221679, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I really like the pattern created with the shapes of these toys! The colors are bright and cheerful and the lighting is great. While this is a good shot I feel it has the potential to be an even better photo. As it is, the overhead angle makes it look flat and one dimensional. Changing the angle say to maybe 45 degrees would show how the light and shadows fall to define these colorful shapes showing off their 3 dimensional shapes and adding more visual interest.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I really like the pattern created with the shapes of these toys! The colors are bright and cheerful and the lighting is great. While this is a good shot I feel it has the potential to be an even better photo. As it is, the overhead angle makes it look flat and one dimensional. Changing the angle say to maybe 45 degrees would show how the light and shadows fall to define these colorful shapes showing off their 3 dimensional shapes and adding more visual interest.', '2018-07-31 23:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587776, 1222308, 57886, '<td valign="top">I don´t know what it is but it looks as spaghetti to me. I find the white dish disturbing, would have cropped it closer or adjusted the angle so the great "pasta" would fill the frame more. The fork could have been cleaner also.  But, a nice idea and I like your "outside of the box" take on the challenge.</td>', 'I don´t know what it is but it looks as spaghetti to me. I find the white dish disturbing, would have cropped it closer or adjusted the angle so the great "pasta" would fill the frame more. The fork could have been cleaner also.  But, a nice idea and I like your "outside of the box" take on the challenge.', '2018-07-31 23:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587778, 1222286, 58728, '<td valign="top">My fave so far.  10</td>', 'My fave so far.  10', '2018-07-31 23:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
