(7589706, 1222233, 149964, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours and beautiful details. Amongst my top picks.</td>', 'Amazing colours and beautiful details. Amongst my top picks.', '2018-08-05 19:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589707, 1222244, 149964, '<td valign="top">I can imagine using this as the picture around which I told someone a story. Once upon a time there was a small, pink flower....<br/>Beautiful use of bold, almost block, colours.</td>', 'I can imagine using this as the picture around which I told someone a story. Once upon a time there was a small, pink flower....Beautiful use of bold, almost block, colours.', '2018-08-05 19:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589710, 1221738, 149964, '<td valign="top">Great selection of complementary colours and textures.</td>', 'Great selection of complementary colours and textures.', '2018-08-05 19:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589713, 1222349, 149964, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous capture and I love the rainbow of colours.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous capture and I love the rainbow of colours.', '2018-08-05 19:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589715, 1221549, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really clever. I hope youll share your technique !</td>', 'Really clever. I hope youll share your technique !', '2018-08-05 19:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589716, 1222338, 149964, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. I really like the bright solid colours.</td>', 'This made me smile. I really like the bright solid colours.', '2018-08-05 19:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589717, 1222414, 149964, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the earthy tones of the avian homes set against the bright green foliage</td>', 'Love the contrast between the earthy tones of the avian homes set against the bright green foliage', '2018-08-05 20:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589718, 1222187, 149964, '<td valign="top">I love the way you have represented the rainbow in a novel way. I recommend Meehra Sodha for orange - and its a great cookbook too!</td>', 'I love the way you have represented the rainbow in a novel way. I recommend Meehra Sodha for orange - and its a great cookbook too!', '2018-08-05 20:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589719, 1221675, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and lots of crisp detail. I love this as an abstract but would have given it a higher mark if I could have defined an object.</td>', 'Beautiful colours and lots of crisp detail. I love this as an abstract but would have given it a higher mark if I could have defined an object.', '2018-08-05 20:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589720, 1222096, 149964, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. A couple of small things distracted me. The first was the arm on the right which looks as though it has been blurred out.  Im wondering if you cropped in a little more from the bottom right whether youd still get the blue haste at the top but less dominating haze at the bottom?</td>', 'Made me smile. A couple of small things distracted me. The first was the arm on the right which looks as though it has been blurred out.  Im wondering if you cropped in a little more from the bottom right whether youd still get the blue haste at the top but less dominating haze at the bottom?', '2018-08-05 20:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589721, 1222396, 149964, '<td valign="top">I particularly  like the reflections on this.</td>', 'I particularly  like the reflections on this.', '2018-08-05 20:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589722, 1222311, 149964, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours. I think I might have preferred it a little  more without the hand.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours. I think I might have preferred it a little  more without the hand.', '2018-08-05 20:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589723, 1222270, 112739, '<td valign="top">This is serious color! Beautiful abstract.</td>', 'This is serious color! Beautiful abstract.', '2018-08-05 20:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589726, 1221781, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment<br/> <br/>Now that is an eyeful of color!!!;-) Love the arrangement of the colored pencils. The colorful ''fence'' has a hole through which opening an eye stares back at the viewer. Colorful, clever, and ...eye-catching!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment Now that is an eyeful of color!!!;-) Love the arrangement of the colored pencils. The colorful ''fence'' has a hole through which opening an eye stares back at the viewer. Colorful, clever, and ...eye-catching!', '2018-08-05 20:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589738, 1221799, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>You serve up four very colorful cocktails that are eye-catching! Great color and detail in this sweet composition. My only critique is that the lighting leaves some distracting shadows on the ground plane - playing with the angles of the lights, light tent, or have a few reflectors would reduce/remove those shadows.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. You serve up four very colorful cocktails that are eye-catching! Great color and detail in this sweet composition. My only critique is that the lighting leaves some distracting shadows on the ground plane - playing with the angles of the lights, light tent, or have a few reflectors would reduce/remove those shadows.', '2018-08-05 20:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589741, 1221393, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the color reflected in all of these camera lens! And fantastic idea for colorful objects - I also like how you have some len''s shutters open in various aperture settings for added visual interest.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the color reflected in all of these camera lens! And fantastic idea for colorful objects - I also like how you have some len''s shutters open in various aperture settings for added visual interest.', '2018-08-05 20:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589743, 1221994, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Some fantastic bold and vibrant oranges in these life vests! Great color and details here - I can see the square pattern in the fabric of these colorful objects. Nicely done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Some fantastic bold and vibrant oranges in these life vests! Great color and details here - I can see the square pattern in the fabric of these colorful objects. Nicely done!', '2018-08-05 20:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589749, 1221973, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok... It''s the processing that makes this, but it makes it less of a photograph, and more of art. But I can deal with that. Because I find this stunning.</td>', 'Ok... It''s the processing that makes this, but it makes it less of a photograph, and more of art. But I can deal with that. Because I find this stunning.', '2018-08-05 21:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589760, 1222349, 68504, '<td valign="top">lovely light, lovely colours, but just a bit too processed and just a bit too intense.</td>', 'lovely light, lovely colours, but just a bit too processed and just a bit too intense.', '2018-08-05 22:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
