(7590083, 1222236, 66384, '<td valign="top">There was nothing in the challenge description that said the image had to be colorful  only the objects. I understood your intention with this image, although I didnt know the sad and disturbing story behind it. So many of our best photos come from our subconscious trying to work out disturbing and painful things.</td>', 'There was nothing in the challenge description that said the image had to be colorful  only the objects. I understood your intention with this image, although I didnt know the sad and disturbing story behind it. So many of our best photos come from our subconscious trying to work out disturbing and painful things.', '2018-08-06 10:27:39.000000', NULL, 0),
